<title>POLAND: Beton Stal extends CP programme to $15 mln.</title>
<headline>Beton Stal extends CP programme to $15 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish construction company Beton Stal SA signed an agreement on extending its commercial paper programme to $15 million from $10 million, the firm said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The programme is carried out by the Bank Handlowy SA brokerage.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
